Measurement-only scaffolding; never lands. <bench> WIFI HACK v11.

The laptop's last boot ran build 6324a013e (the volume-keys branch),
which does not contain v8's keep hack: its log shows BAR 0 of 01:00.0
moved to eight addresses from 0x450200000, all outside the 1 MiB that
bridge 00:02.2 forwards (0xd0600000..0xd0700000), the function silent at
each, and the hand-over refused. v10 already contains v8's keep, so v10
would not take that path; but the keep sat behind the routed-window and
reference-dword gates, either of which refuses the BAR outright.

exit 0
